  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際農產貿易",
    "sub_ename": "INTERNATIONAL TRADE AND AGRICULTURE",
    "describe_ch": "依國際貿易理論與實務運作，應用在國際農產品的出口與進口分析，以增進學生對於農產品國際市場及進出口之認識。同時，結合供應鏈概念，探討從產地至跨國消費地之每一環節與商業模式，開拓學生未來發展之選擇。",
    "describe_eh": "According to the theory and practice of international trade, it is used in the analysis of the export and import of international agricultural products to enhance students' understanding of the international market and import and export of agricultural products. At the same time, combining the concept of supply chain, discussing every link and business model from the place of production to the place of transnational consumption, to explore students' future development options.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
